  "title": "AXIL Brands Launches GS Extreme 3.0 Tactical Earbuds",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, October 30, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) – AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company for AXIL® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3® hair and skin care products, announces the launch of the GS Extreme 3.0, its third-generation tactical lanyard earbud product.",
